OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Tania Leon
OL,6,     F4/5. Kate Molleson explores Tania
OL,7,     FLeon's journey as a conductor
OL,8,     Falongside her composing career,
OL,9,     Fwith the composer in interview.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FKatie introduces live music from
OL,12,     Fthe Tony Kofi & Denys Baptiste
OL,13,     FQuintet.
OL,14,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,15,     FHalf an hour of back-to-back
OL,16,     Fclassical music, including works
OL,17,     Fby Hamilton Harty, Steve Reich,
OL,18,     FHenry Purcell and Pauline Hall.
